        value: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0.7}
        note: 'The scrim under a menu over the card (_3.2 step 8). The project renders in LINEAR colour, so an alpha blends in linear light: 0.5 left the card''s text behind at 181 of 247 (measured), still competing with the menu; 0.7 recedes it to a frame (about 144)'
      - name: --ts-hero-fade
        value: {r: 0.956862745, g: 0.941176471, b: 0.909803922, a: 0.9}
