        note: 'The hero''s scrim behind its words (solid) and the tint of the ramp above them (hero_scrim.png holds the grade). The project blends in LINEAR light, so the alpha is chosen against the WORST pixel any picture can have, pure white: at 0.94 the ground stays at luminance 0.062 and the eyebrow (--ts-on-scrim-2) keeps 7.7:1, the title 9.3:1, over any picture (ThemeContrastTests; 0.92 left the eyebrow 6.7:1 over The Lamp''s sky once its actions took one row, P4.4b part 2). The same in both modes: the hero is a picture'
      - name: --ts-on-scrim
