        note: 'The sheet''s ground between the blocks (R11 tinted glass: light clear, dark smoked): tints card_glass.png, a vertical alpha ramp, so the top is clearer; this alpha is the ramp''s foot'
      - name: --ts-ink
        value: {r: 0.078431373, g: 0.066666667, b: 0.050980392, a: 1}
